  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Excusez-moi, je crois qu'il y a une erreur sur l'addition.",
      "textSHA256": "f7a855c77c1284585c874bd7df23c6d008318ed055b436a1f3bd7f2f3f005004",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 12
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il y a aussi des frais de service de 15 % que personne ne nous a expliqués.",
      "textSHA256": "9d9edd57290d40ef87983ef35f590e5a5e77928a35873e2e083da13ac7303d23",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je dis au serveur : « Excusez-moi, je crois qu'il y a une erreur sur l'addition. »",
      "textSHA256": "702347c666dc4b6240fc15894f8eaabc46b117385fddf16fab5126a7572fa894",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je le remercie et je laisse un pourboire parce que le service était bon.",
      "textSHA256": "441d696803ea6ca92295a59c748f098aeaaeec5dd18d928d6e2084ae7c327613",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je lui montre le reçu et j'explique : « Nous n'avons pas commandé de deuxième bouteille. »",
      "textSHA256": "0c5fb5a96a5311927f2fe6dfbfb6245872a75cda804339e14b85a4b3124309a6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vois deux bouteilles de vin, mais nous n'en avons commandé qu'une.",
      "textSHA256": "9a952327af1f75f9aa3faf01007a56fbda249b28b6883df62db595d0cfb3e4e6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais vérifier l'addition.",
      "textSHA256": "857344daa75f59c53089051a26c03e9e9e9458ee5fdbbb43690554dc399a9adf",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La carte ne mentionne pas ce supplément.",
      "textSHA256": "20b0ae68d2eff227320acc08d71479a28849cbbb982161bc97226fda39401a6d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le serveur constate que la carte ne mentionne pas ce supplément et va en parler au responsable.",
      "textSHA256": "805eab099744af2eaa6a4f0f6fb185fd9d993eae6ffe4985b8372cfa36c278ac",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le total est correct maintenant.",
      "textSHA256": "3e529cd149d8cbd2e4fa3b7a3c658a72bc75420ebc7c11f41c3a0dcac35fb07b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci, le service était bon.",
      "textSHA256": "5bfbeac5da01ce31e7e49deb579a8e10b528683f4f8906bbdcaa878cbb82c1f6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 21
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous n'avons commandé qu'une bouteille.",
      "textSHA256": "0ec78a265a8bb0ebdc1f4ef96815fed7760df00de0c2dc8f636983a6f33d9adb",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous n'avons pas commandé de deuxième bouteille.",
      "textSHA256": "393f03147e0bfafca0562e2f8bcd33541ad731c7eb2c0c680d212d8f8441dae3",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Personne ne nous a expliqué les frais de service.",
      "textSHA256": "5e1519c3a75229b3f4b0ab0182a5858652a5b3e69d2daeecbf21b5ebfe80dc22",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous corriger l'addition, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "c24a0aa8793cb5993d2ac8236f4fe6ab97f46dba72d6bd02ddb92f84a0c8f841",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Puis je lui demande aimablement : « À quoi correspond ce supplément ? »",
      "textSHA256": "8c31294913c4de23777d3d0e7b2563367738e5f066d9f2a249f4656292790295",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Puis-je parler au responsable, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "0937e6fbf177d742e05407831e2e5da3c0bd4c9f4cf3441e5c1c63df0900d3c0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Quelques minutes plus tard, il m'apporte une addition corrigée avec le bon total.",
      "textSHA256": "839c367908a738048874a19a3fe89eb0ff8e81f7e6ca0db27e132cd25e042241",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "le responsable",
      "textSHA256": "dbedb2de0510a94f03ca311cd544d100730489cf6412034dcca871e285e45d4f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "le supplément",
      "textSHA256": "8f245d55a48567d105c6b28f2aa6dfb81c6f464f1f2df9935165bc08b8e4efd2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "À la fin du dîner, le serveur m'apporte l'addition et je la vérifie calmement.",
      "textSHA256": "8201b9968e76db3957403f18a5331756a9918838982dc6a3b1f9ceb942d7b20b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "À quoi correspond ce supplément ?",
      "textSHA256": "e7749d163a6022048a84aa81f0394d8e9dee03250fc8dc4292e668b2864409ca",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:22:fr-en",
